Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kopel, J.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a Crest of friendship glowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we beat the little bat and sent\Nhim and his crew to the showers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we had to find Mimi and the\Nothers, so we all split up again.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.64,0:02:15.11,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Crush! AtlurKabuterimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is extremely perplexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been trying to find\NGennai for over two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got any ideas, Tanemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're walking in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could walk in squares, but\Nthat's not likely to work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a breather and\Nwait for him to come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to take a more\Nscientific approach to this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but even scientists\Nneed to take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to rest, so stop asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely certain that\Nhe's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so, for my feet's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This better work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate it when my otis man gets angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demidevimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice day, huh, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still waiting for you to\Nsteal the crests from those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a surefire way to get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this cute little\Nface, tell a bit, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you're my Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be out of my head to make you mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one more chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't be so\Nbenevolent the next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't steal those crests, he's\Ngoing to rake me over the coals. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to know why\NGennai is so secretive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to discuss the merits\Nof the crest with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that about you, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a never-ending\Nthirst for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing your brain doesn't\Nexplode with all that knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a lot more things I could learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much room do you\Nhave left in your brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Gennai could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all my knowledge,\NI still can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Izzy, it's a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean from above?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How bizarre.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.81,0:04:17.81,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Sign: Beware of large pieces of falling crap ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says, beware of falling sludge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, this could get real ugly. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me this was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we go anywhere but this way. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another sign up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bottomless sludge pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a very pleasant experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've been flushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I never see another\Nsign as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack sludge impossible!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.64,0:04:54.60,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Sign: Beware of savage crap!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How humiliating, attack\Nby an attack sludge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, there doesn't appear to be\Nany other place for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded by sludge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect! I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no bottom to this pit. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that could work in our favor It's\Na lot easier on your head that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you ask me Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's impossible If we fall any farther,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be in a very unpleasant\Nplace. That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anybody need a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have temporarily given\Nyou a life ride You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all those that are\Ngreedy fall into the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I comprehend\Nwhat you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you accusing\Nus of being greedy for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you know too much, of course?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sticking your nose\Nin where it doesn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could possibly be wrong with\Ngaining knowledge and information?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't seem to stop yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're headed straight for the pit if\Nyou don't learn to control yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even know that you're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a disease with you. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Izzy, I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want it to fall in the pit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then give up your curiosity to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's your curiosity that I admire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What procedure should I utilize to\Nkeep us from falling down this pit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't, I won't, I don't want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's more like it. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we finally made it\Nout, but where are we now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope you enjoy your stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Vademon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I personally designed this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vadermon
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Alien Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Akuma no Nage Kiss
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:31.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Abduction Kousen
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vademon was living proof\Nyou should always stay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away from Digimon with\Nunusually large heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That big brain of his was\Nscrambled, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your curiosity is in this sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't want it\Nmessing up my universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hate having clutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's not needed, I sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that that's done i\Nwant you to read my latest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,book it's all you need\Nto know all you need to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know whether you like it\Nor not it happens to be a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bestseller in order to be\None with the universe you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must erase your thoughts\Nbut your thoughts make up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who you are you mustn't\Nerase them it is important
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to breathe into your thoughts\Nuntil they disintegrate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and slowly turn into\Nmush I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The less you think about,\Nthe happier you'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's trying to\Nsend us a transmission!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon your mind will shut down and you\Nwill have nothing left to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home, but I got your\Nmessage that you're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother coming back\Nto the DigiWorld, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll just clutter up the universe, Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ty's risking his life to save you,\NIzzy. Oh, well. He's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indifference is the key to success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Practice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Izzy I knew is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a warehouse full of\Ncuriosities and other castaway items,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all of them are for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always someone\Nwho wants to buy junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the salesman who\Ncan give them a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, curiosity\Nsalesman extraordinaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A penny for your thoughts\Nand a nickel for your fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute, I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, have I got the bargain for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm earning a sale right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams and curiosities\Nare at bottom-line prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's a steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anyone in this picture happen\Nto tumble into your universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, yes, they did. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be in the market\Nfor the curiosities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fetch them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're very fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for brain\Ngarbage, this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to give me a\Nhard time or I'll get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid in the picture was carrying\Na tag and a crust with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not something\NI ordinarily carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a very expensive item, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I trade him\Nfor some of my curiosity?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have a mountain\Nof curious thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you say, Vademon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a deal or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell by looking at\Nyou that you're a Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with enough wacky thoughts\Nto make me a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,F
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,G
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,H Izzy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm preparing my brainwaves by\Nfocusing on some basic fundamentals,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I would rather you did not disturb me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I J
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,K
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,L
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,M
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,M... There's something that\NI forgot to mention to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to fully improve yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must throw away possessions\Nthat are considered excess baggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such as?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just about everything except\Nyour clothes. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you gone bananas?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't throw those away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice-looking trinket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give back that tagging crest,\Nyou poor excuse for a Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off, Bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get back to your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,O
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,P
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Q
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,R
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,U
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,W
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry to make you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah all right come on give me the guts\Nwait don't you recall the deal that we made
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i want a piece of your brain i'm\Ngoing to crank out some of my thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm trying but it's hard\Nto get them out of my head
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!\NThey're stuck! I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,E.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,F. G.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,H.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I. J.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no energy left!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pabu-mon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pabu, Pabu, Pabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to bother\Nme when I'm meditating!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pabu, Pabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten who I am already, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.74,0:13:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to figure out what\Nthe ditchy world really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Izzy, and don't\Nlet go of your curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your curiosity I admire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is merely scientific speculation,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I believe I stumbled onto something\Nmore than just a simple computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Babu! Babu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry, Babumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Babu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to make you digivolve
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a weasel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get Ben all out of shape I always\Ntake shape when I'm mad Give me a break,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get in big trouble It's\Nnot my concern, you pesky pipsqueak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat it, pal. Oh, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my Otis man will pull my feathers out\Nif I don't bring him that tagging crust.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got yourself into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can get yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a big brute. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm mixed up because my curiosity's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I believe somehow I've been tricked,\Nso I must implement a plan to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Babu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, all I'm\Ncoming up with is a big zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Babu! Babu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some way I can\Nget my curiosity out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't figure out how. Pabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out! Forget it!\NIt's mine! No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want a bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand it over, you old coot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've really got me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's stolen the tagging\Ncrest! Let's get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you come from anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good work, Pabu Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got the crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to follow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it up, you pesky pavits, right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Digis, you found my curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a mistake to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I just tossed it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.78,0:16:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curiosity is essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.60,0:16:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pabu! Pabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it transfers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppetmon, it's time for you to digibow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moochimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Motimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dizzy, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I need is some pest control to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I've never been very\Npartial to vermin, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, you got a Digimon! Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, no less Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon, super-evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.91,0:18:36.88,Sign,,0,0,100,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}AtlurKabuterimon {\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.91,0:18:36.88,Sign,,370,0,140,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.91,0:18:36.88,Sign,,370,0,185,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.91,0:18:36.88,Sign,,370,0,240,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Insect Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.91,0:18:36.88,Sign,,370,0,335,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.91,0:18:36.88,Sign,,370,0,370,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Horn Buster
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He digivolved to ultimate\NMega Kabuterimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can take him on, Venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a surprise for him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mega Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing like a speeding planet to give\Nthem the ultimate headache, Horn Blasters!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, thanks, Little Commissarimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is wake up are you all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right i was so worried
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm fine i'm so tired\Ni can barely stand up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. All right,\Nthat's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't know Izzy.\NAwesome, you made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're back. Yeah,\Nwe're back. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah better now tell us what\Nhappened yeah how did you get
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here we thought you were a\Ndigi gunner Izzy was taking a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,self improvement class I improved\Nso much I flunked right out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hello kids it's been a while it's\NGennai the connection between
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is still damaged.\NYou'll have to stay long there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've collected some information about the\Ndigital world that you'll be able to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you take a\Nlook at the Digimon file.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll tell you all you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's\Nanyone we know in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just downloaded my\Nfavorite, MegaKabuterimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm a cool dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.82,0:20:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A funny thing happened to\Nme on the way to Vademon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to face the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this part!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me sit in this tree all night!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of heights!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I at least have the milk and cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold and cold, so it's\Na jacket on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a time when I'm going\Nto see you, it's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:22:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the sun is in the\Nsky, I can't remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a warm-up, that day, that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
